# SPA fallback for any path not prerendered as a static file.
# IMPORTANT: target is EXTENSIONLESS (/__spa-fallback, NOT /__spa-fallback.html).
# Cloudflare Pages auto-strips ".html" and 308-redirects /x.html -> /x, so a
# ".html" target here creates an infinite redirect loop. Pages serves the file
# __spa-fallback.html at the path /__spa-fallback, so we rewrite to that.
/*    /__spa-fallback    200
